```cpp
template <typename T, typename U>
__aicore__ inline void Cast(const LocalTensor<T>& dst, const LocalTensor<U>& src,
    const RoundMode& roundMode, const uint32_t count);
```

So Cast takes `(dst, src, roundMode, count)`. I need to provide a `RoundMode` value.

Common RoundMode values are:
- `RoundMode::RNE` - Round to Nearest Even
- `RoundMode::RU` - Round Up
- `RoundMode::RD` - Round Down
- `RoundMode::RZ` - Round Toward Zero

For typical precision conversion, `RoundMode::RNE` is the default and most accurate.

